<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47788" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰλέθω</span></b> , poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλλω</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰλέω</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bloom, thrive</i>, used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάμνος ἐλαίης . . θαλέθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					23.191
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ibyc.
				1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.843
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίου θαλέθοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					20.3
				</span></i>
			; of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠΐθεοι θαλέθοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλέθοντα τόκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1363
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλέθεσκες ἐν εἴαρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.374
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰεὶ θαλέθοντι βίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
					98
				</span></i>
			 (= <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				373
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύες θαλέθοντες ἀλοιφῇ</span>
			<i>swelling, wantoning</i> in fat, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.467
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.32
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίην λειμῶνες θαλέθουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
